          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">To start running on a treadmill, run in short pieces between walking
            breaks, at a pace slow enough to talk, three times a week, and add running time a little
            at a time.</strong> Typical beginner jogging speeds are around 4 to 5.5 mph with the
            incline at 0 or 1%, but the talk test, not the display, should decide your speed.
          </p>
